# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
import lib/cadkernel/transform2.dl
import tests/cadkernel/cross2/support.dl

function check transform ownership {boolean:condition}:
    execute:
        if condition = false:
            @intrinsic("call", "libc", "exit", nothing, 98)

function retained transform2 spline:
    execute:
        set original to cross2 interpolated spline
        set by to a cad insertion2 at (cross2 point [2.0,-3.0]) scaling (cross2 point [1.5,0.5]) through 0.7
        set moved to the cad transformed original by by
        check transform ownership moved's valid
        check transform ownership (original's nurbs's controls != moved's value's nurbs's controls)
        check transform ownership (original's nurbs's knots != moved's value's nurbs's knots)
        check transform ownership (original's nurbs's weights != moved's value's nurbs's weights)
        free cad curve original
        return moved

set base to the cad default transform2
check transform ownership (base = the cad identity transform2)
set copied to the cad clone of base
set copied's origin's x to 17.0
check transform ownership (base's origin's x = 0.0)
check transform ownership ((base = copied) = false)
set result to retained transform2 spline
set retained to result
free cad curve result's value
set point to the cad point on retained's value at 0.0
check transform ownership ((the cad distance from point to (cross2 point [2.0,-3.0])) < 1e-12)

set chain to cross2 polyline [[1.0,2.0,0.0],[3.0,4.0,0.0],[5.0,6.0,0.0]] with closure true
set moved to the cad transformed chain by (a cad scale2 by -2.0 and 3.0)
check transform ownership moved's valid
check transform ownership (chain's polyline's vertices != moved's value's polyline's vertices)
check transform ownership moved's value's polyline's closed
free cad curve chain
set point to (the item at 0 in moved's value's polyline's vertices)'s position
check transform ownership ((point's x = -2.0) and (point's y = 6.0))
set chain to cross2 polyline [[0.0,0.0,1.0],[2.0,0.0,0.0]] with closure false
set moved to the cad transformed chain by (a cad scale2 by 2.0 and 1.0)
check transform ownership (moved's valid = false)
set copy to moved
free cad curve moved's value
free cad curve copy's value
check transform ownership ((the length of chain's polyline's vertices) = 2)
print "affine values and independently owned transformed curves" as a line
